%% Diagram: DevHarness Repository CI/CD Pipeline
%% ID: HARNESS-D24 | Version: 0.1 | State: Validation is implemented; release/deploy is not
flowchart LR
  change["Branch push or pull request"] --> checkout["Checkout with persisted credentials disabled"]
  checkout --> docs["Repository documentation / asset validation"]
  docs --> tests["DevHarness unit tests"]
  tests --> harness["Harness docs and diagram-link validation"]
  harness --> check{"Required validate job passes?"}
  check -->|No| fail["Block merge; report failure"]
  check -->|Yes| review["Human PR review and resolved conversations"]
  review --> merge["Owner-controlled merge to main"]
  merge -. release / deployment remains manual and unconfigured .-> deploy["Future release boundary"]
